  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.2: XOD SQL (SELECT) in .NET and the xod CLI; every context holds the database's and the folder's lock files; values, maps and lists read back as written; a failed commit is undone at once, and one a crash cut short at the next open; a password change is all or nothing; property encryption with a key of the database's own; autonumber seeds and increments. Some behaviour changes: read https://xod.sabaeon.com/docs/upgrading before upgrading. All notes: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/RELEASE-NOTES-2.0.2.md. XOD 2.0: a rework of the 2017 library. Versions before 2.0.0 (0.1.x and the 1.0.0 betas) were MIT; 2.0.0 is Apache-2.0. Migration guide from 1.x: https://github.com/mhsallam/xod/blob/main/docs/MIGRATION-GUIDE.md",
